This project is a fan-made compatibility and preservation patch. It contains no
game code, artwork or data files from The Game of Life: SpongeBob SquarePants
Edition. You supply your own copy of the game.

"The Game of Life: SpongeBob SquarePants Edition" (2007) and its assets are the
property of their respective rights holders - THQ, Nickelodeon (Viacom) and
Hasbro. "The Game of Life" is a Hasbro trademark. "SpongeBob SquarePants" is a
Nickelodeon trademark. This project is not affiliated with, authorised by or
endorsed by any of them.

The launcher displays the game's title artwork by reading it at runtime from the
copy already installed on the user's own machine
(game/textures/tex_menu_titlebg.jpg). That file is never copied, bundled,
embedded or redistributed by this project.

The game is built on Virtools 4.0 (CK2) by Dassault Systemes. The patch
interoperates with it through the public Direct3D 9 API only; no Virtools code
is included or modified.

The MIT license in LICENSE covers only the patch, the launcher and the build
tooling in this repository.
